            "type_local": "世界文化遗产古塔 - 夜间广场游览",
            "notes_base": "Giant Wild Goose Pagoda (652 AD, Tang Dynasty) is directly adjacent to Da Tang Bu Ye Cheng - a 5-10 min walk north. Evening plaza visit is FREE - the North Plaza (大雁塔北广场) features a spectacular musical fountain show at 20:00 and 21:30 (free to watch). The illuminated pagoda at night is one of Xi'an's most iconic photo spots. Temple interior (50 CNY) and pagoda climb (30 CNY extra) are closed after ~18:00-19:00, but the exterior plaza and fountain area remain accessible and are best appreciated at night. Combining with 长安十二时辰 + 大唐不夜城 makes a complete Tang Dynasty evening. Allow 30-45 min for plaza and fountain viewing.",
            "notes_local": "大雁塔建于652年（唐代），距大唐不夜城步行仅5-10分钟。夜间广场游览免费——大雁塔北广场每晚20:00和21:30有大型音乐喷泉表演（免费观看）。夜间灯光下的大雁塔是西安最具代表性的拍照胜地之一。大慈恩寺内部（50元）和登塔（另需30元）约18:00-19:00关闭，但外部广场和喷泉区域夜间开放，且夜景更为壮观。配合长安十二时辰+大唐不夜城构成完整的盛唐文化之夜。建议预留30-45分钟观看广场和喷泉。",
            "opening_hours": "North Plaza: Open late (fountain shows 20:00 & 21:30); Temple interior: 08:00-18:00 (closed evenings)",
            "optional": false,
            "time": {
              "start": "21:35",
              "end": "22:20"
            },
