            "type_base": "UNESCO World Heritage Site - Archaeological Museum",
            "type_local": "世界文化遗产 - 考古博物馆",
            "notes_base": "USER HAS TIMED RESERVATION: 15:31-16:30. Allow ~90 min travel from hotel (鼓楼和平门 area) by taxi or tourist bus. Depart hotel by ~13:30-14:00 to reach museum by 15:00, check in at 15:31. One of the world's greatest archaeological discoveries: 8,000+ life-size terracotta soldiers guarding Emperor Qin's tomb. Must see Pit 1 (largest), Pit 2 (horses+chariots), and bronze chariot exhibition. Admission 120 CNY (~17 USD). Book online in advance - the reservation is already made (15:31 entry slot). From 鼓楼/和平门 hotel: 1) Taxi ~80-100 CNY, ~50 min. 2) Tourist bus 华旅兵马俑观光巴士-钟楼线 from 钟楼东 (~20 CNY, ~60 min). Dress warmly - pits are large unheated indoor halls in winter.",
            "notes_local": "用户已预约：15:31-16:30入场。从鼓楼和平门酒店出发约需90分钟：1) 打车约80-100元，约50分钟。2) 乘华旅兵马俑观光巴士钟楼线，约20元，约60分钟。建议13:30-14:00从酒店出发。票价120元（已包含三个坑全部内容）。世界最伟大考古发现之一：8000多件真人大小的兵马俑守护秦始皇陵。必看：一号坑（最大）、二号坑（有战马战车）、铜车马展览。冬天坑内较冷，注意保暖。",
            "opening_hours": "08:30-17:00 (last entry 16:00 in winter)",
            "optional": false,
