            "notes_base": "USER HAS TIMED VISIT: 09:00-10:30. Free admission but ADVANCE RESERVATION REQUIRED via WeChat official account (陕西历史博物馆) or official website. Book at least 1-3 days ahead. China's premier history museum showcasing over 170,000 artifacts spanning from Prehistoric through Tang Dynasty periods. Highlights: Tang Dynasty gold/silver artifacts, ancient bronzeware, frescoes from Tang tombs. Note: Special exhibition hall (珍宝馆) requires separate paid ticket (~30 CNY). From hotel (鼓楼和平门): ~25 min by taxi or Metro Line 3 to 小寨 then walk/taxi. Depart hotel by 08:30 to arrive on time. The 1.5-hour slot is adequate for main exhibitions.",
